{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"startIndex"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/incidencematrixmodule\/orientedincidencematrix\/hyperedges-swift.struct\/startindex"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix\/Hyperedges-swift.struct\/startIndex"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule","doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix","doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix\/Hyperedges-swift.struct"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Inherited from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Collection.startIndex"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","title":"startIndex","modules":[{"name":"IncidenceMatrixModule"}],"externalID":"s:21IncidenceMatrixModule08OrientedaB0V10HyperedgesV10startIndexSivp","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"startIndex"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix.swift#L412"},"roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property"},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://IncidenceMatrixModule/documentation/IncidenceMatrixModule/OrientedIncidenceMatrix":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The oriented incidence matrix of a directed hypergraph: entry (v, p) is −1 when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"v"},{"type":"text","text":" is a source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of column "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"p"},{"type":"text","text":", +1 when it is a target, and 0 otherwise. Gallo, Longo, Pallottino and Nguyen"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(1993) define a directed hypergraph’s matrix this way (aᵢⱼ = −1 for a tail node, 1 for a head"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"node); a directed graph’s edge is the column with one source and one target, the matrix of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"spectral graph theory (B·Bᵀ = L, Godsil–Royle §8.3) and NetworkX’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"incidence_matrix(oriented=True)"},{"type":"text","text":". It conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DirectedHypergraph"},{"type":"text","text":", so the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Hypergraphs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"algorithms (B- and F-connection, components, the clique expansion) run on it unchanged; it is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DirectedGraph"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"url":"\/documentation\/incidencematrixmodule\/orientedincidencematrix","kind":"symbol","title":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://IncidenceMatrixModule/documentation/IncidenceMatrixModule":{"abstract":[],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule","url":"\/documentation\/incidencematrixmodule","title":"IncidenceMatrixModule","role":"collection"},"doc://IncidenceMatrixModule/documentation/IncidenceMatrixModule/OrientedIncidenceMatrix/Hyperedges-swift.struct":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Hyperedges"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every column as its sources and targets, at its position."}],"url":"\/documentation\/incidencematrixmodule\/orientedincidencematrix\/hyperedges-swift.struct","kind":"symbol","title":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix.Hyperedges","identifier":"doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix\/Hyperedges-swift.struct","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Hyperedges"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://IncidenceMatrixModule/documentation/IncidenceMatrixModule/OrientedIncidenceMatrix/Hyperedges-swift.struct/startIndex":{"title":"startIndex","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"startIndex"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix\/Hyperedges-swift.struct\/startIndex","url":"\/documentation\/incidencematrixmodule\/orientedincidencematrix\/hyperedges-swift.struct\/startindex"}}}